// An events since cursor is the since query key.
// A longer key keeps its own name.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE since ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG since law

IMPULSE since 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "since" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
